; The maintainer's visual validation playground: one suite that exercises
; every output surface windtrap has, with most tests FAILING BY DESIGN so
; every failure report renders. This is a plain (executable), NOT a (test)
; stanza, and it is deliberately not attached to runtest: wiring it in
; would turn the whole-tree `dune runtest` red forever. The default alias
; still builds it, so it cannot bit-rot silently. Run it directly:
;
;   dune exec examples/x-demo/main.exe
;
; See README.md in this directory for the guided tour of what to look at.
; The instrumentation stanza is inert without --instrument-with; with it,
; runs additionally print the inline coverage line (over main.ml itself).

(executable
 (name main)
 (modules main)
 (libraries windtrap)
 (instrumentation
  (backend ppx_windtrap)))
